---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = '2026-05-28';
---
<BaseLayout title="Now" description="What MingHsuan Lee is currently working on, reading, and building.">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 py-24">
    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-4">
      <h1
        class="font-serif text-ink"
        style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 44;"
      >
        Now
      </h1>
      <a href="/zh-tw/now" class="text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink no-underline">中文 →</a>
    </div>
    <p class="text-muted text-xs font-mono tracking-wider uppercase mb-16">
      Last updated &nbsp;·&nbsp; {lastUpdated}
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-14">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-muted uppercase tracking-[0.18em] mb-5" style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">Currently focused on</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-text leading-relaxed" style="font-size: 1.0625rem;">
          <li class="pl-5 relative before:content-['—'] before:absolute before:left-0 before:text-muted">Writing the Context Engineering series — production decisions for embeddings, retrieval, and context management.</li>
          <li class="pl-5 relative before:content-['—'] before:absolute before:left-0 before:text-muted">Shipping the paid version of a personal investment-research agent — turning it into a small SaaS.</li>
          <li class="pl-5 relative before:content-['—'] before:absolute before:left-0 before:text-muted">Running a personal AI assistant lab for code review, ops, and content drafts.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-muted uppercase tracking-[0.18em] mb-5" style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">Recently shipped</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-text leading-relaxed" style="font-size: 1.0625rem;">
          <li class="pl-5 relative before:content-['—'] before:absolute before:left-0 before:text-muted">Bilingual blog (English / 繁體中文) — same content, both languages.</li>
          <li class="pl-5 relative before:content-['—'] before:absolute before:left-0 before:text-muted">Site rebuild around writing rather than agent demos.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-muted uppercase tracking-[0.18em] mb-5" style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">Currently learning</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-text leading-relaxed" style="font-size: 1.0625rem;">
          <li class="pl-5 relative before:content-['—'] before:absolute before:left-0 before:text-muted">MCP server design patterns at scale — discovery, versioning, security boundaries.</li>
          <li class="pl-5 relative before:content-['—'] before:absolute before:left-0 before:text-muted">Hybrid retrieval (vector + lexical + rerank) trade-offs in mixed-language corpora.</li>
          <li class="pl-5 relative before:content-['—'] before:absolute before:left-0 before:text-muted">Operational economics of running multiple production AI agents on a single VPS.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <div class="ornament" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        This page updates whenever my focus shifts — usually monthly. Inspired by the <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">now page movement</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
